 * @description The billing overview — the screen a finance team opens on the
 *   first of the month. Composed, not assembled: this block owns the whole
 *   page body, from the one headline figure down to the last CTA, so a route
 *   that renders it renders a product rather than a grid of unrelated tiles.
 *
 * It takes plain data and renders. It reads no service, knows no router, and
 * derives every figure here, so it can be dropped into any route that can
 * supply invoices and runs — that is the seam the block layer exists for.
 *
